# Supabase (Expo)

- Use `getSupabase()` from `@/lib/supabase/client` — do not inline `createClient` with hard-coded keys.
- Prefer anon key + RLS from the app. Never ship `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in the client bundle.
- After creating tables in Supabase, regenerate types into `src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts` (include `Relationships` on each table for current `@supabase/supabase-js`).
- Env: `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`.
